<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mini House Lagoa Santa - Invista num flat que já gera renda</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
:root {
  --orange: #E05100;
  --orange-light: #FF6A1A;
  --gray: #737376;
  --gray-dark: #3a3a3c;
  --gray-darker: #1c1c1e;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --off-white: #F7F7F7;
  --font: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
}
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { font-family: var(--font); color: var(--gray-dark); background: var(--white); overflow-x: hidden; }

nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 18px 48px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  transition: background 0.3s;
}
nav.scrolled { background: rgba(28,28,30,0.97); }
nav img { height: 48px; }
nav a {
  color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0.85; transition: opacity 0.2s;
}
nav a:hover { opacity: 1; }
.nav-cta {
  background: var(--orange); color: var(--white) !important;
  padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 4px; opacity: 1 !important;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--orange-light) !important; }

.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: center center / cover no-repeat;
  position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center;
}
.hero::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.65) 60%, rgba(224,81,0,0.20) 100%);
}
.hero-content {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  max-width: 780px; padding: 120px 48px 80px;
}
.hero-badge {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(224,81,0,0.18); border: 1px solid rgba(224,81,0,0.4);
  color: #ff8c4a; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.hero-badge span { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--orange); border-radius: 50%; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);} 50%{opacity:0.5;transform:scale(1.4);} }
.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5.5vw, 68px); font-weight: 900; color: var(--white);
  line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.hero h1 em { color: var(--orange); font-style: normal; display: block; }
.hero p {
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 20px); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 400; max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.btn-primary {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  background: var(--orange); color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 16px 36px;
  border-radius: 6px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(224,81,0,0.4);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--orange-light); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(224,81,0,0.5); }
.btn-primary svg { transition: transform 0.2s; }
.btn-primary:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }
.hero-proof {
  margin-top: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.proof-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
}
.proof-item strong { color: var(--white); }
.proof-sep { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-size: 18px; }

.numbers { background: var(--white); padding: 80px 48px; }
.section-label {
  text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.section-title {
  text-align: center; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  font-weight: 800; color: var(--gray-darker);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 56px;
}
.numbers-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 2px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  background: #eee; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
}
.number-card {
  background: var(--white); padding: 44px 32px;
  text-align: center; transition: background 0.2s;
}
.number-card:hover { background: var(--off-white); }
.number-card .value {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 42px); font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--orange); letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.number-card .label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; }
.asterisk-note {
  text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; max-width: 1100px;
  margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); font-style: italic;
}

.argument { background: var(--gray-darker); padding: 100px 48px; }
.argument-inner {
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;
}
.argument .section-label { text-align: left; }
.argument .section-title { text-align: left; color: var(--white); }
.argument p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.argument p strong { color: var(--white); }
.benefits-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
.benefits-list li {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500;
}
.benefit-check {
  width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(224,81,0,0.2); border: 1.5px solid var(--orange);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
  color: var(--orange); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900;
}
.argument-visual { position: relative; }
.argument-img {
  width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; object-fit: cover; height: 480px;
  box-shadow: 0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
.float-card {
  position: absolute; bottom: -24px; left: -32px;
  background: var(--orange); color: var(--white);
  padding: 20px 28px; border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(224,81,0,0.4);
}
.float-card .fc-value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; }
.float-card .fc-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px; }
.price-tag {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 20px; margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.price-tag .pt-label { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
.price-tag .pt-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--white); }
.price-tag-divider { width: 1px; height: 40px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); margin: 0 8px; }

.how { background: var(--off-white); padding: 100px 48px; }
.how-steps {
  max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 0; position: relative;
}
.how-steps::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 40px; left: 10%; right: 10%; height: 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--orange) 0%, rgba(224,81,0,0.2) 100%);
}
.how-step { text-align: center; padding: 0 20px; position: relative; }
.step-num {
  width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--white); border: 3px solid var(--orange);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  margin: 0 auto 24px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--orange);
  position: relative; z-index: 1; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(224,81,0,0.15);
}
.step-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gray-darker); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.step-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.7; }

.gallery { background: var(--white); padding: 100px 48px; }
.gallery-grid {
  max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: 280px 280px; gap: 8px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
}
.gallery-item { overflow: hidden; position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
.gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }
.gallery-item.span-col { grid-column: span 1; grid-row: span 2; }
.infra-grid {
  max-width: 900px; margin: 48px auto 0;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px;
}
.infra-item { background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 16px; text-align: center; }
.infra-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.infra-text { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray-dark); }
.ratings-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 40px; margin-top: 48px; }
.rating-badge {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  background: var(--off-white); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 28px;
}
.rating-value { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--orange); }
.rating-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray); }

.lagoa {
  min-height: 520px;
  background: center 40% / cover no-repeat;
  position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center;
}
.lagoa::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 60%, transparent 100%);
}
.lagoa-content {
  position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 620px; padding: 80px 48px;
}
.lagoa-content .section-label { text-align: left; }
.lagoa-content h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 42px); font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--white); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.2;
}
.lagoa-content p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.lagoa-content p strong { color: var(--white); }

.compare { background: var(--off-white); padding: 100px 48px; }
.compare-table {
  max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;
  border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.compare-table table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--white); }
.compare-table th, .compare-table td {
  padding: 18px 24px; text-align: center;
  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
}
.compare-table th {
  background: var(--gray-darker); color: var(--white);
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.compare-table th.highlight { background: var(--orange); }
.compare-table td.highlight { background: rgba(224,81,0,0.05); font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange); }
.compare-table td.highlight-neutral { background: rgba(224,81,0,0.05); font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray-dark); }
.compare-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.compare-table .check { color: #22c55e; font-size: 18px; }
.compare-table .cross { color: #d1d5db; font-size: 18px; }
.compare-notes {
  max-width: 960px; margin: 24px auto 0;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
}
.compare-notes p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; }
.compare-notes span { font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; color: var(--gray-dark); }

.cta-final {
  background: var(--gray-darker); padding: 100px 48px; text-align: center;
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.cta-final::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -20%; width: 60%; height: 200%;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(224,81,0,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cta-final h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--white); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.cta-final h2 span { color: var(--orange); }
.cta-final p {
  font-size: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 40px; line-height: 1.7;
}
.cta-final .btn-primary { font-size: 16px; padding: 18px 48px; }
.privacy-note { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-weight: 500; }

footer {
  background: #111; padding: 40px 48px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;
}
footer img { height: 44px; }
.footer-text { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 600px; }

.modal-overlay {
  display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 999;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
}
.modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }
.modal {
  background: var(--white); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 40px; max-width: 640px; width: 100%;
  position: relative; animation: slideUp 0.35s ease;
  max-height: 92vh; overflow-y: auto;
}
@keyframes slideUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(32px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.modal-close {
  position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;
  background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 22px; color: var(--gray); transition: color 0.2s; z-index: 2;
}
.modal-close:hover { color: var(--gray-darker); }
.modal h3 {
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gray-darker);
  margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.modal-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
.modal iframe { display: block; width: 100%; border: none; border-radius: 8px; }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  nav { padding: 16px 24px; }
  nav a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
  .hero-content { padding: 100px 24px 60px; }
  .numbers-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .argument-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
  .argument-visual { display: none; }
  .how-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); gap: 40px; }
  .how-steps::before { display: none; }
  .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto; }
  .gallery-item.span-col { grid-column: span 2; height: 260px; }
  .infra-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .numbers, .how, .gallery, .compare, .cta-final, .argument { padding: 64px 24px; }
  .lagoa-content { padding: 64px 24px; }
  footer { padding: 32px 24px; flex-direction: column; }
  .compare-table th, .compare-table td { padding: 14px 10px; font-size: 12px; }
  .modal { padding: 28px 20px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav id="navbar">
  <img id="logoImg" src="" alt="Mini House">
  <a href="#numeros">Números</a>
  <a href="#empreendimento">O Flat</a>
  <a href="#lagoa">Lagoa Santa</a>
  <a href="#" class="nav-cta" onclick="openModal(event)">Quero investir</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="heroSection">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span></span>
      Oportunidade de investimento - Lagoa Santa, MG
    </div>
    <h1>
      Este apartamento rendeu <em>R$ 3.962</em> no mês passado.
    </h1>
    <p>Invista num flat em Lagoa Santa que já opera, já gera renda e praticamente se paga com o próprio rendimento. Entrada a partir de R$ 50.000. Gestão 100% profissional.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn-primary" onclick="openModal(event)">
      Quero conhecer a oportunidade
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </a>
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <div class="proof-item">⭐ <strong>4,8</strong> no Google</div>
      <div class="proof-sep">·</div>
      <div class="proof-item">🏆 <strong>9,0</strong> no Booking</div>
      <div class="proof-sep">·</div>
      <div class="proof-item">🏠 Operando há <strong>mais de 4 anos</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="numbers" id="numeros">
  <div class="section-label">A operação em números</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Resultados reais de uma operação consolidada</h2>
  <div class="numbers-grid">
    <div class="number-card">
      <div class="value">R$ 249.000</div>
      <div class="label">Valor da unidade</div>
    </div>
    <div class="number-card">
      <div class="value">R$ 3.962</div>
      <div class="label">Rendimento bruto médio<br>por unidade / mês*</div>
    </div>
    <div class="number-card">
      <div class="value">R$ 2.034*</div>
      <div class="label">Resultado líquido médio<br>por unidade / mês</div>
    </div>
    <div class="number-card">
      <div class="value">+4 anos</div>
      <div class="label">de operação<br>comprovada</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="asterisk-note">* Valor antes da dedução de impostos incidentes sobre a renda. Resultados baseados no histórico da operação.</p>
</section>

<section class="argument">
  <div class="argument-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">Por que faz sentido</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Use seu FGTS. Deixe o rendimento trabalhar por você.</h2>
      <div class="price-tag">
        <div>
          <div class="pt-label">Valor da unidade</div>
          <div class="pt-value">R$ 249.000</div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-tag-divider"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="pt-label">Entrada a partir de</div>
          <div class="pt-value">R$ 50.000</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>Você adquire o flat dando uma entrada a partir de <strong>R$ 50.000</strong> - que pode ser o seu FGTS - e financia o restante pelo banco. Simples assim.</p>
      <p>O rendimento histórico médio da unidade praticamente empata com a parcela estimada do financiamento - e tende a superá-la à medida que as parcelas caem pelo sistema SAC. Na prática, o próprio imóvel caminha para pagar o que você deve ao banco.</p>
      <p>Você constrói <strong>patrimônio real</strong>, escriturado no seu nome, sem comprometer sua renda mensal.</p>
      <ul class="benefits-list">
        <li><div class="benefit-check">✓</div> Entrada a partir de R$ 50.000 - FGTS aceito</li>
        <li><div class="benefit-check">✓</div> Rendimento que praticamente cobre a parcela do financiamento</li>
        <li><div class="benefit-check">✓</div> Imóvel escriturado com matrícula individual</li>
        <li><div class="benefit-check">✓</div> Gestão 100% profissional - você não opera nada</li>
        <li><div class="benefit-check">✓</div> Liberdade para vender sua unidade quando quiser</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary" onclick="openModal(event)">
        Quero saber se tenho perfil
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="argument-visual">
      <img id="flatOverviewImg" src="" class="argument-img" alt="Interior do flat">
      <div class="float-card">
        <div class="fc-value">R$ 2.034*</div>
        <div class="fc-label">resultado médio / mês</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how">
  <div class="section-label">Sem complicação</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Como funciona para o investidor</h2>
  <div class="how-steps">
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-title">Aquisição</div>
      <div class="step-text">Você adquire uma unidade com escritura e matrícula individualizada.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-title">Integração</div>
      <div class="step-text">Sua unidade entra no sistema de locação por temporada - Airbnb, Booking, Expedia e site próprio.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-title">Gestão profissional</div>
      <div class="step-text">Gestora especializada cuida de tudo: hóspedes, limpeza, manutenção e administração financeira.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-step">
      <div class="step-num">4</div>
      <div class="step-title">Você recebe</div>
      <div class="step-text">Os resultados líquidos são distribuídos mensalmente entre os proprietários. Sem trabalho.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gallery" id="empreendimento">
  <div class="section-label">O empreendimento</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Conheça a Mini House Lagoa Santa</h2>
  <p style="text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 48px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.7;">Flats de 21m² totalmente mobiliados e equipados, operando há mais de 4 anos com avaliações excepcionais.</p>
  <div class="gallery-grid">
